anti-shishan-kit incorporates designs and adapted logic from DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), which is released under the
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek.

Adapted mechanisms include: the Agent Notes lifecycle and frozen archive seal,
the Markdown/doc-budget gate designs, the ratchet baseline design
(hash-fingerprinted, monotonic-debt baselines), and the single-verdict CI
pattern. All adaptations were rewritten for language-agnostic use; see the
Agent Note `.agents/notes/implemented/process/2026-09-28-govkit-v0-1-design.md`
for the provenance map.
